# EXPERIMENT-DIFFICULTY-CONFOUND, EXPERIMENT-TEXT-BASELINE-TRANSFER and EXPERIMENT-MULTILEVEL-FUSION reuse the EXPERIMENT-POWERED-REPLICATION recordings via local hard links; the record is algorithms/powered-replication/data (hash-identical)
